[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0492","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-25177","title":"LuaJIT luajit2 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"LuaJIT 2.1 及之前版本与 OpenRusty luajit2 v2.1-20240314 之前版本中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当 JIT 编译器对 NULL metatable 执行 IR_FSTORE 指令的 unsinking 优化时，由于未正确检查空指针条件，攻击者可通过构造特制的 Lua 脚本触发该漏洞，导致目标应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响广泛使用 LuaJIT 的 Web 服务器、游戏引擎及嵌入式系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-25177"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-07T17:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:15:39Z","remediation":"升级 OpenRusty luajit2 至 v2.1-20240314 及以上版本（该版本已修复 IR_FSTORE 对 NULL metatable 的取消下沉问题）。使用上游 LuaJIT 的项目应更新至包含该修复的最新 2.1 分支提交。无法立即升级时，可限制不可信 Lua 脚本的执行权限，避免传递 NULL metatable 触发漏洞造成服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/pwnhacker0x18/a73f560d79f2c3d4011d6c5a2676f04a","https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT/commit/85b4fed0b0353dd78c8c875c2f562d522a2b310f","https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT/issues/1147","https://github.com/openresty/luajit2/commit/85b4fed0b0353dd78c8c875c2f562d522a2b310f","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00022.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-25177.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/25xxx/CVE-2024-25177.json","https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/blob/2dc52eb3ae78954685e1c0e03bdda8669c7fb2bb/changelogs/1.35.4.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-25177.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-25177","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/luajit/luajit/CVE-2024-25177.patch","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/3c0945e34109d51978c088d0e68eb6af7923c4f4/upstream-layers/meta-openembedded/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/luajit/luajit_git.bb","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/luajit/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-25177.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-25177.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0492.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0491","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0491.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-25176","title":"LuaJIT 数字格式化栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"LuaJIT 及 OpenRusty luajit2 的 lj_strfmt_num.c 文件中 lj_strfmt_wfnum 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的格式化字符串输入触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行或服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 LuaJIT 2.1 及之前版本、OpenRusty luajit2 早于 v2.1-20240626 的版本，无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-25176"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-07T17:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:15:38Z","remediation":"立即将 LuaJIT 升级至包含 commit 343ce0ed 的修复版本（≥2.1 主分支），或使用 OpenResty luajit2 v2.1-20240626 及以上版本。Debian 用户可安装对应 LTS 安全更新。如无法升级，避免将 LuaJIT 暴露于不可信输入，并限制 `string.format` 等触发数值格式化路径的调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/pwnhacker0x18/cd75d01fc7c9b6c85c183fbe5353d276","https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT/commit/343ce0edaf3906a62022936175b2f5410024cbfc","https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT/issues/1149","https://github.com/openresty/luajit2/commit/343ce0edaf3906a62022936175b2f5410024cbfc","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/08/msg00022.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-25176.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/25xxx/CVE-2024-25176.json","https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/blob/2dc52eb3ae78954685e1c0e03bdda8669c7fb2bb/changelogs/1.35.4.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-25176.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/l/luajit/luajit.spec","https://github.com/PartialVolume/shredos.x86_64/blob/a34dc4959ddba8f5c3046d6bd371ad20ab3c3d39/package/luajit/luajit.mk","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-25176","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/3c0945e34109d51978c088d0e68eb6af7923c4f4/upstream-layers/meta-openembedded/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/luajit/luajit_git.bb","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/luajit/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-25176.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0491.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0705","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0705.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-6174","title":"Canonical cloud-init 权限提升漏洞","description":"cloud-init 在检测到非 x86 平台时，会向硬编码的本地 IP 地址 URL 授予 root 访问权限，构成不当认证漏洞（CWE-287）。攻击者可在同一局域网段内无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，获取目标系统的 root 控制权，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。该漏洞影响 cloud-init 25.1.3 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。官方已在 25.1.3 版本中通过禁用平台枚举的默认配置修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-6174"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-26T10:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:17:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 cloud-init 至 25.1.3 或更高版本（https://github.com/canonical/cloud-init/releases/tag/25.1.3）。如无法升级，在 cloud.cfg 中设置 `disable_platform_enumeration: true` 以禁用平台枚举功能，并确保非 x86 平台不使用硬编码本地 IP 地址的认证方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/canonical/cloud-init/releases/tag/25.1.3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/6xxx/CVE-2024-6174.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/6xxx/CVE-2024-6174.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/cloud-init/CVE-2024-6174.patch","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-6174","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-6174.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/c/cloud-init/cloud-init.spec","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-6174.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-6174.json","https://github.com/canonical/cloud-init/blob/f19affc8df980a4daff3b8250d4b4b262ce24232/ChangeLog","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9c64290b74a702cc2cb0f57d040036009e789093/py-cloud-init/TODO"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0705.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0471","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11584","title":"Canonical cloud-init hotplugd 套接字权限设置不当漏洞","description":"cloud-init 至 25.1.2 版本中，systemd socket 单元 cloud-init-hotplugd.socket 默认 SocketMode 设置为 0666，导致 /run/cloud-init/hook-hotplug-cmd FIFO 文件全局可写。本地低权限攻击者可向该 FIFO 写入恶意载荷触发 hotplug-hook 命令，以 root 权限执行任意操作。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 cloud-init 的 Linux 发行版，危害中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11584"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-06-26T10:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:58:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 cloud-init 至 25.1.3 及以上版本（apt upgrade cloud-init 或从 GitHub 拉取最新源码编译安装）。如无法立即升级，编辑 systemd 单元覆盖文件 /etc/systemd/system/cloud-init-hotplugd.socket.d/override.conf 添加 SocketMode=0640，执行 systemctl daemon-reload && systemctl restart cloud-init-hotplugd.socket 后核查 /run/cloud-init/ 下 FIFO 文件权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/canonical/cloud-init/pull/6265/commits/6e10240a7f0a2d6110b398640b3fd46cfa9a7cf3","https://github.com/canonical/cloud-init/releases/tag/25.1.3","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-11584"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0526","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47081","title":"PSF Requests 凭据泄漏漏洞","description":"Python Requests 库存在 URL 解析缺陷，攻击者可通过构造恶意 URL 诱导用户访问，导致 .netrc 文件中存储的凭据被泄露给第三方。该漏洞影响 Requests 2.32.4 之前的所有版本，利用条件为攻击者需诱使用户通过 Requests 库访问特制 URL，且目标环境中存在 .netrc 凭据文件。成功利用可导致敏感凭据泄露，影响系统安全。建议升级至 2.32.4 及以上版本，或通过设置 trust_env=False 禁用 .netrc 加载以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47081"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-09T18:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:30Z","remediation":"升级 Python Requests 库至 2.32.4 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade requests）。如无法立即升级，在创建 Session 时设置 trust_env=False 禁用 .netrc 自动加载，或在代码中移除 .netrc 文件依赖。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/psf/requests/commit/96ba401c1296ab1dda74a2365ef36d88f7d144ef","https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/6965","https://github.com/psf/requests/security/advisories/GHSA-9hjg-9r4m-mvj7","https://requests.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/#requests.Session.trust_env","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/2","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Jun/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/03/11","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/03/9","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/04/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/06/04/6","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47081.md","https://github.com/psf/requests/blob/69f84847045bef7a849cc994a26fe7ba8a169e95/HISTORY.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47081.json","https://github.com/stitchdata/docs/blob/c761c223d93d11979029024d935446a84a7be75c/_changelog-files/2025/2025-06-24-bigcommerce-v1-bump-requests-to-resolve-cve-2024-47081.md","https://github.com/AgriciDaniel/claude-seo/blob/09d37c7b66ed3ca9c6efbdb765a805a6c76a8f01/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/requests/CVE-2024-47081.yml","https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/blob/6e3b4eab87bc1ec9e58d76361507e9e0be27dd4f/src/azure-cli-core/HISTORY.rst","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-47081","https://github.com/docker/docs/blob/7ca960b7a2bcb58ede70bd84d2b4202c13004e1e/content/manuals/dhi/how-to/scan.md","https://github.com/Helicone/helicone/blob/67df07b8d807a960f2e53d9ec2a9c49513ca2379/valhalla/dockerfile"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0505","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-13088","title":"QNAP QHora QuRouter 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"QHora 路由器 QuRouter 系统存在身份认证绕过漏洞（CWE-287）。攻击者在获得本地网络访问权限后，无需有效凭证即可利用该漏洞绕过身份验证机制，进而破坏系统安全性。该漏洞影响 QuRouter 2.5.0.140 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.2，危害等级中危。QNAP 已在 QuRouter 2.5.0.140 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-13088"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-06-06T16:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:01:09Z","remediation":"立即将 QHora 设备的 QuRouter 固件升级至 2.5.0.140 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议在路由器管理界面中将管理端口仅绑定到内网可信接口，并启用访问控制列表（ACL）限制仅允许受信任 IP 地址访问管理后台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-25-15","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13088.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2024/13xxx/CVE-2024-13088.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2024-13088","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-13088.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-8m5f-fx5r-2p23/GHSA-8m5f-fx5r-2p23.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-13088","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-13088.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-13088","https://github.com/begumsozer/Atelier_Data_Project/blob/c180b70b99084444dad46b49963b14f4cf496528/cve_ids.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2024/CVE-2024-13088.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0481","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12718","title":"Python tarfile 模块提取过滤器绕过漏洞","description":"Python tarfile 模块在处理不受信任的 tar 归档文件时存在路径遍历漏洞。当使用 TarFile.extractall() 或 TarFile.extract() 方法并设置 filter 参数为 \"data\" 或 \"tar\" 时，攻击者可通过构造特制的 tar 文件绕过提取过滤器，修改提取目录之外文件的元数据（如最后修改时间）或文件权限（chmod）。该漏洞仅影响 Python 3.12 及以上版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至修复版本或避免使用 filter 参数处理不可信 tar 文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12718"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-03T13:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Python 升级至 3.10.18、3.11.13、3.12.11、3.13.4 或 3.14.0b3 及以上版本，这些版本已修复 tarfile 模块中 filter=\"data\" 和 filter=\"tar\" 绕过提取过滤器的路径遍历问题。如无法升级，在调用 TarFile.extractall() 和 TarFile.extract() 时避免使用 filter=\"data\" 或 filter=\"tar\"，改用 filter=\"fully_trusted\" 并手动校验路径是否在目标目录内，或使用 shutil.unpack_archive() 替代。对于 3.14+ 用户，注意默认 filter 已从\"不过滤\"变更为\"data\"，切勿依赖默认行为解压不可信 tar 包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/sethmlarson/52398e33eff261329a0180ac1d54f42f","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/19de092debb3d7e832e5672cc2f7b788d35951da","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/28463dba112af719df1e8b0391c46787ad756dd9","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/3612d8f51741b11f36f8fb0494d79086bac9390a","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/4633f3f497b1ff70e4a35b6fe2c907cbe2d4cb2e","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9c1110ef6652687d7c55f590f909720eddde965a","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9e0ac76d96cf80b49055f6d6b9a6763fb9215c2a","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/aa9eb5f757ceff461e6e996f12c89e5d9b583b01","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/dd8f187d0746da151e0025c51680979ac5b4cfb1","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/127987","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/135034","https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/135037","https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/MAXIJJCUUMCL7ATZNDVEGGHUMQMUUKLG/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12718.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12718.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbab