ub.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/22xxx/CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-22653","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2024/22xxx/CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/yasm/yasm/CVE-2024-22653.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-22653.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-22653.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-22653-yasm-commit-9defefae-was-discovered-1771410935000.md","https://github.com/foundriesio/docs/blob/3727e8eed2efbebec87b04f63db7cb011bf62a6c/release-notes/v96/changelog_v96.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0490","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-23337","title":"jqlang jq 整数溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"jq 是一款命令行 JSON 处理器，其 jv.c 文件中的 jvp_array_write 函数存在有符号整数溢出漏洞。当攻击者使用索引值 2147483647（有符号整数上限）向数组赋值时，会触发整数溢出，导致程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 jq 1.7.1 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，但需要目标系统运行 jq 处理特制的 JSON 输入。官方已在 commit de21386681c0df0104a99d9d09db23a9b2a78b1e 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-23337"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-21T15:16:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:12:37Z","remediation":"升级 jq 至 1.8.0 及以上版本（该版本限制数组/对象最大元素数为 536870912，彻底修复整数溢出问题）；如无法升级，可通过打补丁方式应用 commit de21386681c0df0104a99d9d09db23a9b2a78b1e；临时缓解措施：避免使用 jq 处理包含超大索引（接近 2147483647）的不可信 JSON 输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/jqlang/jq/commit/de21386681c0df0104a99d9d09db23a9b2a78b1e","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3262","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/security/advisories/GHSA-2q6r-344g-cx46","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-23337.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2024/23xxx/CVE-2024-23337.json","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/blob/2d410d6d86be7f685ad28e5cffac0248aa47664c/NEWS.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-23337.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-23337","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2024/23xxx/CVE-2024-23337.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/jq/APKBUILD","https://github.com/hashicorp/hcp/blob/22914bf04188992bd99f6dea82da226d9204f62b/.release/security-scan.hcl","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/jq/jq/CVE-2024-23337.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-23337.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0530","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0530.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-47619","title":"OneIdentity syslog-ng TLS证书通配符匹配绕过漏洞","description":"syslog-ng 日志守护进程的 TLS 证书主机名验证功能存在通配符匹配过于宽松的安全漏洞。`tls_wildcard_match()` 函数错误地允许了 `foo.*.bar` 这类不合规的通配符证书模式，同时还能匹配 `foo.a*c.bar` 等部分通配符，这违反了 TLS 证书验证标准。攻击者可通过中间人攻击利用此缺陷，使用精心构造的恶意证书绕过主机名验证，导致 TLS 连接被劫持，破坏通信完整性。该漏洞影响 syslog-ng 4.8.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 4.8.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-47619"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-07T16:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:57:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 syslog-ng 至 4.8.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 TLS 证书通配符匹配过于宽松的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 TLS 配置中禁用通配符证书匹配，或使用明确的非通配符证书替代。对于使用 syslog-ng 的 Linux 发行版，请关注各发行商的安全更新推送。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/blob/b0ccc8952d333fbc2d97e51fddc0b569a15e7a7d/lib/transport/tls-verifier.c#L78-L110","https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/commit/dadfdbecde5bfe710b0a6ee5699f96926b3f9006","https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/releases/tag/syslog-ng-4.8.2","https://github.com/syslog-ng/syslog-ng/security/advisories/GHSA-xr54-gx74-fghg","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00034.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-47619.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-47619","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/47xxx/CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2024-47619-2025-05-28-0905","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-47619.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-47619.html","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-47619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/8c0b8a4513f8428fb95d9bc26f586638701c0668/references/contrib1-CVE-2024-47619-2025-05-28-0905"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0530.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0699","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0699.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58100","title":"Linux 内核 BPF 扩展程序 changes_pkt_data 属性校验漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统中存在一个安全漏洞。当 BPF 验证器处理全局子程序调用时，会根据子程序的 changes_pkt_data 属性决定是否使当前状态中的所有包指针失效。扩展程序（EXT）在替换全局子程序时，若其 changes_pkt_data 属性与被替换的子程序不兼容，验证器可能错误地处理包指针状态，导致内核状态不一致。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的 BPF 程序利用此漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务（可用性影响为高）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 5.6 至 6.6.89 及 6.7 至 6.12.24 版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58100"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-05T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:38Z","remediation":"升级到包含 bpf 安全修复的 Linux 内核版本，具体版本取决于具体的内核分支和安全维护计划。检查内核版本和安全更新公告（如 Red Hat、Ubuntu、Debian 等厂商的补丁列表），并更新到包含 bpf verifier changes_pkt_data 检查功能的版本。如无法立即更新，可临时限制 BPF 程序加载权限或使用安全配置来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3846e2bea565ee1c5195dcc625fda9868fb0e3b3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7197fc4acdf238ec8ad06de5a8235df0c1f9c7d7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81f6d0530ba031b5f038a091619bf2ff29568852","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58100.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58100.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58100","https://github.com/sroman0/explotability_analysis_ebpf/blob/3fc370718634495cb93ed823792e98c9c809f97d/report/src/CVE-2024-58100.tex","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58100.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58100.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58100.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58100.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-28h8-49pj-mw67/GHSA-28h8-49pj-mw67.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2024-58100"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0699.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0698","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0698.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58098","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 全局函数数据包指针验证绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF（Berkeley Packet Filter）子系统中存在安全漏洞。BPF 验证器在处理全局子程序中的辅助函数调用时，未能正确遍历全局子程序以跟踪数据包指针的失效状态。当全局子程序调用 bpf_skb_pull_data 等会改变数据包数据的辅助函数后，调用者状态中的数据包指针未被正确标记为无效，导致后续仍可使用已失效的指针访问数据包内存。本地攻击者可通过加载特制的 BPF 程序利用此漏洞，造成内核内存越界访问，导致系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58098"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-05T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.90、6.12.25 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应补丁提交为 79751e9227a5、1d572c60488b、51081a3f25c7。如无法立即升级，可通过 SELinux 或 AppArmor 限制 BPF 程序的加载权限，仅允许受信进程加载 BPF 程序作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1d572c60488b52882b719ed273767ee3b280413d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/51081a3f25c742da5a659d7fc6fd77ebfdd555be","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/79751e9227a5910c0e5a2c7186877d91821d957d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58098.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58098.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58098","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58098.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58098.md","https://github.com/sannaclaudia/EBPF_exploits/blob/264a6fc8b51a99bd3dc130c65ccabf84e9105529/exploits/CVE-2024-58098/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58098.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58098.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58098-bpf-track-changes-pkt-data-property-1771411497000.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-58098"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0698.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0700","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58237","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 尾部调用数据包指针失效漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF（Berkeley Packet Filter）子系统中存在尾调用导致数据包指针失效的安全漏洞。当 BPF 程序通过尾调用（tail call）跳转到另一个 BPF 程序时，原程序持有的数据包指针（packet pointer）未正确失效，攻击者可利用此缺陷构造特制的 BPF 程序序列，在指针失效后继续访问已释放或重新分配的内存区域，导致越界读取或释放后使用（Use-After-Free）。本地攻击者若具备加载 BPF 程序的权限（如非特权 BPF 已启用），可通过精心构造的 BPF 程序触发该漏洞，造成系统崩溃或潜在的信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，Red Hat 评估为中等严重性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58237"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-05-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-05-05T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：6.6 LTS 分支升级到 6.6.90 及以上，6.12 分支升级到 6.12.9 及以上，或直接升级到 6.13 及以上版本。对应修复提交为 f1692ee23dca、1c2244437f9a、1a4607ffba35。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 BPF 程序中的尾部调用来临时缓解，但建议优先完成内核升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58237.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58237.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58237.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58237","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58237.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/agent/blob/04ca3d7145f1fedbc9cc09cf4cc1d5921344bd16/prompt/context/CVE-2024-58237/rootCause2plan_file.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58237.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58237.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58237.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-hv6f-p3fq-464p/GHSA-hv6f-p3fq-464p.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0703","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0703.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58251","title":"BusyBox netstat ANSI终端转义序列注入拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BusyBox 1.37.0及之前版本中的 netstat 工具存在 ANSI 转义序列注入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意网络应用程序，在进程名 argv[0] 中嵌入 ANSI 终端转义序列，当受害用户使用 netstat 命令查看网络连接时，终端将解析这些恶意转义序列，导致终端锁定或显示异常，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度高，需本地访问且依赖用户交互，影响面有限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58251"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-23T18:16:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:42Z","remediation":"升级 BusyBox 至 1.37.0 以上版本，或应用 Alpine Linux 提供的补丁 0036-Fix-CVE-2024-58251-sanitize-process-names-when-calli.patch 对 netstat 输出中的进程名进行转义处理。如无法立即升级，避免在不可信终端环境中执行 netstat 命令，或使用 `cat` 等管道重定向 netstat 输出以阻止 ANSI 转义序列生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugs.busybox.net/show_bug.cgi?id=15922","https://www.busybox.net","https://www.busybox.net/downloads/","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/04/23/6","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58251.md","https://github.com/wolfi-dev/os/blob/4ae0ee4f5788cbd2eeb7439ebf00ec74966e3354/busybox/CVE-2024-58251.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58251.json","https://github.com/hashicorp/boundary/blob/a1e2c87b8a14eb1c8fd45a282f5e4e740f156b10/.release/security-scan.hcl","https://github.com/authelia/authelia/blob/3b0bbd3d786ad6602124e0d23d561deb98fe7bf4/.grype.yaml","https://github.com/grafana/loki/blob/f4f2af8fcd83bf0211a5c462479e0ae1a00ff00f/docs/sources/setup/upgrade/_index.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/014d362740704f2a1dce5260ec50d71ffe23328e/main/busybox/0036-Fix-CVE-2024-58251-sanitize-process-names-when-calli.patch","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58251.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/tracee/blob/592d74b3501560dd85075b3c418ed00dbeb00a1e/builder/Dockerfile.alpine-tracee-container","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-58251.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0703.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0697","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0697.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58097","title":"Linux kernel ath11k 无线驱动拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ath11k 无线驱动在处理监视器目标环（monitor destination ring）时存在无限循环漏洞。当驱动从硬件接收无效的 buf_id 时，无法获取对应的有效缓冲区，导致目标环处理陷入死循环，进而引发内核崩溃（RCU stall）。本地攻击者可通过低权限访问触发该条件，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 WCN6855、QCN9074 等芯片的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58097"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-16T15:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.14.2、6.12.68 或 6.6.122 及以上版本（含对应稳定分支修复）。Ubuntu 25.04 用户更新至 linux-image-6.14.0-22-generic (6.14.0-22.22) 并重启系统。无法立即升级时，可卸载 ath11k 内核模块（modprobe -r ath11k_pci）禁用受影响无线网卡驱动作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/16c6c35c03ea73054a1f6d3302a4ce4a331b427d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8db5de0cf02fccf4c759aa58edbe65659daf607c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9f1a002f0171d27f3554e529f3c70df438f05dfe","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b4991fc41745645f8050506f5a8578bd11e6b378","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58097.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58097.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58097","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58097.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blo